===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# [[alive|Alive]]
#: {{ux|en|I'm not dead yet!  I'm still '''here'''!}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|+}}

# This [[place]]; this [[location]].
#: {{ux|en|'''Here''' is where I met my spouse twelve years ago.}}
#: {{ux|en|An Alzheimer patient's '''here''' may in his mind be anywhere he called home in the time he presently re-lives.}}
## {{lb|en|figuratively}} This [[point]] or [[stage]] in time, conceptualised as a location.
##: {{ux|en|I'd like to continue my story, but '''here''' is where I must stop.}}
##: {{ux|en|I've done as much as I can; you'll have to take it from '''here'''.}}
# {{rfv-sense|en}} {{lb|en|abstract}} This [[time]], the [[present]] [[situation]]. {{rfex|en}}

====Translations====
{{see translation subpage|Noun}}

===Interjection===
{{en-intj}}

# {{lb|en|slang}} {{non-gloss|Used semi-assertively to offer something to the listener.}}
#: {{ux|en|'''Here''', now I'm giving it to you.}}
# {{lb|en|Irish|British|slang}} {{non-gloss|Used for emphasis at the beginning of a sentence when expressing an opinion or want.}}
#: {{ux|en|'''Here,''' I'm tired and I want a drink.}}
# {{lb|en|informal}} {{non-gloss|Used to attract someone's attention, often in a hostile way.}}
#: {{ux|en|'''Here'''! You! Stop doing that!}}
# {{n-g|Said in response to one's name being called during a [[roll call]], indicating that one is present.}}
#: {{ux|en|Smith ... '''Here'''! ... Jones ... '''Here'''! ... Walters ... ... Anyone seen Walters?}}
# {{n-g|Said to command a person or higher animal to come to the speaker.}}
#: {{ux|en|"Fido! '''Here'''!" — "Woof! Woof!"}}

